Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,隐藏身份的美魔女妈友\N在箱式店重逢后私下乱伦中出\NDASS-843
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,精品字幕\N@98堂最爱X怡\N匠心之作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.07,0:00:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这个真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这是在哪里买的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就是车站前新开的那家店
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.23,0:00:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,已经开业啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都想去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,听说口碑很好的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,甜度也刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦真是太好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.18,0:00:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,比起这个，玛丽姐你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.82,0:00:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我家孩子最近整天都在玩手机
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.82,0:00:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,亮太也是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我家孩子也是光盯着手机看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.75,0:00:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽姐家也是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,真不知道有没有什么解决办法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.94,0:01:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,规定观看时间之类的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我家那位在家里也是整天盯着手机
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子就顶嘴说“爸爸都在看，为什么我不行”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你老公是在用手机处理工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.89,0:01:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不，肯定不是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.34,0:01:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得他偷偷摸摸的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是在看些不健康的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.14,0:01:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不会做那种事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.05,0:01:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是那种闷骚型的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,闷骚？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.36,0:01:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.50,0:01:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是那样背地里偷偷搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.29,0:01:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,真让人意外呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.09,0:01:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,老公，快去洗手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.30,0:01:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,脏死了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,今天怎么回来这么早
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:01:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有个会议取消了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.08,0:02:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思，长舌妇聊了这么久
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.70,0:02:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,别在意我，请慢慢坐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.80,0:02:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,快吃快吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这家店好像也能堂食，下次我们要一起去哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,务必要去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真开心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.64,0:02:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,听说种类超级多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,非常时髦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那种地方果然还是要女生一起去才好玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.52,0:02:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你们喜欢就好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我是甜食党嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.62,0:02:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对了老公
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.27,0:02:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,下周的教学参观日
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不是下下周吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说了日程改了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.74,0:02:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.31,0:02:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.26,0:03:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.12,0:03:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,工作的事情你明明马上就会记到日程APP里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.11,0:03:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,家里的事情你就这么敷衍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,也不用说成那样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他不也是为了支撑这个家才拼命工作的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是那样...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我话说重了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我才要道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.45,0:03:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我会注意的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈友立花小姐...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,温柔又漂亮，跟我老婆简直是天壤之别
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真想跟这种极品做一次，哪怕一次也好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,太忙了难免会烦躁嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,也是会有那种时候呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你在发什么呆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.92,0:04:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我先回房间了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该好好顶回去才对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不知不觉就变成那样了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.90,0:04:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有烦躁的时候，说话也会变得很难听
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,呐，明日香
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,久违地来一发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:04:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我很累
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天你也是这么说的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话我很寂寞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我累了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,要做家务，还要照顾孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你连教学参观的事都忘得一干二净
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那个我已经道过歉了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你就不能原谅我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.02,0:05:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在气你太自私了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,都说对不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.40,0:05:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我先睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天的事真让人火大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么只有我必须忍耐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,老子绝对要去叫个鸡爽一把
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Luna酱？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,立花太太的艺名？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这种片假名我没见过呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.16,0:06:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我是看了网站介绍联系你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，可以指名Luna酱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Luna酱现在有空吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.71,0:06:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:06:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我挂电话后马上到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,最多60分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.34,0:07:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我姓石原
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,电话号码就是现在这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.01,0:07:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那就拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,挂了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Luna酱居然有空，太走运了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.82,0:07:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Luna
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.60,0:07:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,立花太太？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,石原先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会在这...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.44,0:08:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.70,0:08:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,情况有点尴尬，我先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.33,0:08:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,钱已经付过了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.86,0:08:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那个嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.10,0:08:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这样太对不起你了，如果不介意的话，就接受服务吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不，这怎么行...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你不愿意吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不，完全没有不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,能让立花太太服务我是很开心啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,但是，绝对不要告诉任何人哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.36,0:09:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那是当然
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝对不会告诉任何人的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.10,0:09:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你经常来这种店吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.85,0:09:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不，完全没有...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好久没来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.22,0:10:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,被你脱衣服感觉怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,下面你自己来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.91,0:10:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那毛巾...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.02,0:11:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,脱下的衣服放哪里好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.48,0:11:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,放这里就好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.64,0:11:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们去洗澡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,让我帮你洗澡可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.19,0:12:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,很有精神嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.70,0:13:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会指名我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,网站上的照片...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得很像立花太太
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.14,0:13:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，没想到真的是本人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.74,0:14:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.01,0:14:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可能要忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,还不能射哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.10,0:14:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.76,0:14:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,帮你冲掉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.60,0:15:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,请回到垫子上来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.66,0:16:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不，那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真的可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,事到如今...那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不，毕竟你都付了钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不，嘛，也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.98,0:17:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可以摸这里哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.14,0:19:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真熟练啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啦，是你硬起来的反应太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.14,0:19:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,请翻过身来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,要喝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.44,0:21:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.10,0:27:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的很敏感呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.24,0:27:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你技术真好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.90,0:28:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.58,0:28:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.80,0:30:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.72,0:34:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.36,0:34:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,最喜欢了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.92,0:36:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好硬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.00,0:36:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,立花太太，要射了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.64,0:36:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.05,0:36:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.36,0:37:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦，这种事要保密哦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.70,0:37:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,立花太太，真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.58,0:37:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但是，要是下次再去店里肯定会沉迷的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.12,0:37:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓就这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.92,0:37:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,仅此一次
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.80,0:37:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,呐，老公
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.24,0:37:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.14,0:37:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,浴室的排水口堵住了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.76,0:37:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.16,0:37:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯什么嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.17,0:37:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,明明知道还放在那里不管吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.85,0:37:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不不
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.44,0:37:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那样的，我是想等会儿弄
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.03,0:37:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等会儿是什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.92,0:37:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真够了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.67,0:37:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的，整天光看手机
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.10,0:38:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,都说对不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.24,0:38:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.04,0:38:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.66,0:38:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,石原先生
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.22,0:38:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你又来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.08,0:39:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.00,0:39:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我还想再见立花太太一面
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.16,0:39:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.44,0:39:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,跟妻子有点矛盾
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.40,0:39:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,所以，想让立花太太治愈我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.96,0:39:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你能依赖我，我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.26,0:39:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.22,0:39:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,要洗澡对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.40,0:40:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,时间太宝贵了，就这样直接做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.98,0:40:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.62,0:40:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,和立花太太接吻，超级舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.34,0:41:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,上次也是我自己躺好的，真害羞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.86,0:42:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,味道没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.00,0:42:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.96,0:52:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是背着店里偷偷做的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.62,0:52:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,能进去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.42,0:52:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.36,0:52:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，该怎么动才好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.24,0:52:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们两人的秘密哦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.42,0:52:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,想进去
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.74,0:52:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,插进来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.54,0:53:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,要对店里保密哦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.92,0:54:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.12,0:54:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好像非常兴奋的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.72,0:54:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我好开心
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.28,0:55:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我好久没这么爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.26,0:55:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,腰都软了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.90,1:11:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.14,1:11:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.80,1:11:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.30,1:11:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,超级舒服的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.44,1:11:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不能说的秘密又增加了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.46,1:15:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,亮太的事搞定了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.84,1:15:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你去问他本人不就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.41,1:16:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么还要对我咂舌啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.38,1:16:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你烦躁个什么劲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.91,1:16:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才也是摔摔打打的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.36,1:16:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,本来就是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.91,1:16:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,叫你参与育儿，结果全都推给我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.98,1:16:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.60,1:16:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,工作很累的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.74,1:16:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这点小事你就不能看着办吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.48,1:16:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,明日香，你也太容易烦躁了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.18,1:16:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那是说我错了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.25,1:16:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,本来就是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.56,1:16:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.51,1:16:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我带亮太走
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.50,1:16:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我不在更好是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.26,1:16:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要离家出走
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.70,1:16:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回娘家
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.84,1:16:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,明日香，等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.48,1:16:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,等等啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.52,1:16:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你再考虑一下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.52,1:16:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,明日香
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.00,1:17:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的，吵架什么的我受够了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.12,1:17:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.70,1:17:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,今天明日香小姐不在吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.08,1:17:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她回娘家了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.56,1:17:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,娘家？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.60,1:18:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微又吵了一架
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.52,1:18:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.30,1:18:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,立花太太跟老公不吵架吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.16,1:18:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,吵架吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.64,1:18:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,吵不起来呢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.36,1:18:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,吵不起来？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.76,1:18:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直出差
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.16,1:18:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,都不回家的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.08,1:18:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,很寂寞吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.74,1:18:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.46,1:18:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好想被治愈啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.82,1:18:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.21,1:18:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我也被立花太太治愈了很多次
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.96,1:19:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,想稍微回报你一下
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.30,1:19:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.42,1:20:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.28,1:20:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.10,1:20:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好温暖
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.64,1:21:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,暖暖的好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.90,1:21:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那天的事我一直忘不了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.22,1:22:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,让我听听立花太太的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.30,1:22:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.10,1:22:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.06,1:22:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.22,1:23:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.64,1:23:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,保持这样
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.04,1:23:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,把腿张开
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.40,1:24:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.32,1:24:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,变得舒服起来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.16,1:24:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要弄那里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.18,1:25:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,想让你舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.32,1:25:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.34,1:26:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,快射了，等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.94,1:26:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好怀念
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.12,1:26:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.62,1:27:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,爽死了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.42,1:29:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看更多
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.38,1:32:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢被抓着
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.00,1:35:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不接电话好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.14,1:35:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不用管
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.32,1:35:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果，明天明日香小姐也不在的话
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.28,1:35:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,明天能见面吗
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.48,1:36:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.92,1:36:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就是在这张床上做爱的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.16,1:36:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那是以前的事了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.92,1:36:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但是，这反而让我更兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.42,1:36:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，我满脑子想的都是立花太太
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.31,1:39:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.72,1:39:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要去啦
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.15,2:00:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不能说的事情又增加了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.40,2:00:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不用再保密了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.80,2:00:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,请留在这个家里，跟我一起生活吧
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.61,2:01:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一周后
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.64,2:01:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,立花太太，谢谢你总是帮我
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.06,2:01:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我喜欢打扫嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.12,2:01:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人打扫还是挺累的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.92,2:01:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一起做不就好了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.92,2:01:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,今天想吃什么
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.02,2:01:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,想吃鱼
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.94,2:01:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,还有呢
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.94,2:01:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不过立花太太做的饭都很好吃
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.36,2:01:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,到底想吃什么
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.16,2:01:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,去买菜吧
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.73,2:02:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,一起去买东西吧
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.14,2:02:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,老公！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.14,2:02:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.28,2:02:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,把离婚届寄到我娘家是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.11,2:02:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是你自己要离家出走的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.31,2:02:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,反倒是你寄回来才奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.34,2:02:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,也联系不上你
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.22,2:02:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你这到底算什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.80,2:02:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那就谈谈吧
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.38,2:02:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.94,2:02:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谈多久都行
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.28,2:02:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,谈是可以谈，但是明日香我警告你
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.92,2:02:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这婚是离定了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.87,2:02:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么鬼话啊
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.56,2:02:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来为什么玛丽姐会在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.68,2:02:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,跟她没关系
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.80,2:02:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.42,2:02:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是我家诶
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.78,2:02:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟明日香离婚，然后跟立花太太结婚
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.52,2:02:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么疯话啊
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.88,2:02:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽姐，你不是有老公吗
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.68,2:02:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.74,2:03:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会再联系你的，请你出去
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.90,2:03:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,脑子有病吧
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.17,2:03:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你是疯了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.84,2:03:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,总之待会再谈
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.51,2:03:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但是，玛丽姐有老公孩子要怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.64,2:03:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你在想什么呢
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.58,2:03:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,精品字幕\N@98堂最爱X怡\N匠心之作
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.11,2:03:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,橘玛丽 领衔主演

